    <div class="dossier-faq-list">

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: What is a creepypasta?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Horror copy-paste stories</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Is Slender Man real?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Created for an art contest</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Dangerous internet legends?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> Momo, Blue Whale</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Why "pasta"?</span>
            <p class="dossier-faq-a"><strong>A:</strong> From "copy-paste"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dossier-faq-item">
            <span class="dossier-faq-q">Q: Scariest digital myths?</span>
